{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Pfaff型"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“Pfaff 型”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Pfaff 型是偶数维反对称矩阵的一个函数. 在"},{"Local":{"url":"陈--Weil理论","text":"陈–Weil 理论"}},{"Plain":"中, Pfaff 型对应 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler类","text":"Euler 类"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $A=(a_{ij})$ 是反对称矩阵, 将其对应到 $2$-向量 $\\omega = \\sum_{i&lt;j} a_{ij} e_i \\wedge e_j$, 定义 $\\operatorname{Pf}(A)$ 满足\n$$\r\n\\frac{1}{n!}\\omega^n = \\operatorname{Pf}(A) e_1\\wedge\\cdots \\wedge e_n.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对反对称矩阵 $A$, $\\operatorname{Pf}(A)^2 = \\det (A)$. 对任意矩阵 $P$, $\\operatorname{Pf}(P^T AP) = \\det (P) \\operatorname{Pf}(A)$.</p>\n"}]}}